{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A flaky local landing check can send an agent looking for a CI job that may not exist, wasting work and delaying the retry."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"diag","trigger":"plausible","reason":"The documentation incorrectly describes provider contention as ending a run, although the run waits for a slot."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An older or unlinked blocked entry can retain its old reason after repair, misleading an agent seeking the head to approve."}]}